  "guid": "com.dvize.ailimit",
  "name": "Ai Limit",
  "slug": "ai-limit",
  "teaser": "Temporarily disable far bots to reduce cpu load",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/iFN5tmtV0BCSMeEQLeU1CoMwB4x4XgF27OU2xmbj.png",
  "downloads": 58182,
  "favourites_count": 38,
  "description": "<p>For more FPS you can try NVidia Smooth motion with NVidia GPU RTX 4000+</p>\n<p>Disable AI (temporarily) based on distance to the player and user defined bot limit within that distance. Only the closest bots (distance wise) are enabled based on a max value you set in bepinex config.</p>\n<p>For instance, i could set the AI Distance limit to 400 and the bot limit to 5.</p>\n<p>Within that max distance of 400, my version will only enable the closest 5 bots.</p>\n<p>Once you kill the bots close to you, it could activate bots up to your maximum much further away.</p>\n<p>Don’t use this mod with Questing Bots.<br />\nQuesting Bots have their own AI Limiter.</p>\n<p>Original mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/793-ai-limit/?highlight=ai%20li#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI Limit</a></p>\n",
